Run this command in your terminal in the directory OpenShot was downloaded to verify the SHA256 checksum:
  echo "70eacf59edef65cfb0c73678a1195ebd1cef3a328d202e4d915b7feeb4294416  OpenShot-v4.0.1-x86_64.exe" | shasum -a 256 --check

You should get the following output:
  OpenShot-v4.0.1-x86_64.exe: OK